ial recognition feature, HoloMon also recognizes the real world.\nIf you nod or make a hand sign, HoloMon will respond to you.\nEnjoy your life with HoloMon.", "short_description": "This is an application to make friends with the mixed reality pet \"HolographicMonster(HoloMon)\".\nThe goal is to live with HoloMon in the real world and raise him to be a big monster.\nYou can give HoloMon food, play with a ball, and so on."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverSquare_1440x1440_1-1.png", "id": "9172328979490389", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57570293_9172328986157055_8670910801304381989_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CXDsrt_ZQo0Q7kNvwHQCnB9&_nc_oc=AdqUTwBnWo7FTeh4YFQZCYgrY5OJL0IpU7usrScih8nqSyndDCFBsEJ59NiYFsttzGg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXKxHg3GpUyZIOCZty3P0zSkPiRmlwjPDysxsus1IBV2g&oe=6B0F1C86"}, {"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900_10-3.png", "id": "2288044464904587", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982472_2288044468237920_89714264810729936_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CQ9fns0kMY0Q7kNvwEx3MBQ&_nc_oc=Adqvmc3vmQ1ZnQU2HD1EtfmyEtY0bHFgx9OMDV20EqLsaeK23Y_zOQIlcPZhh1g--IE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWyFv6expJXe4ks2S7NR9HU0m-aoLmS2iL7zK7KWvV1HA&oe=6B0F04E0"}, {"file_name": "CoverLandscape_2560x1440_16-9.png", "id": "1819020505602835", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982637_1819020508936168_3095875184930134309_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CW2yKy5iV_UQ7kNvwGsoosY&_nc_oc=AdrBmqZcYBVs_K3ljKlHrxrVbYv6vBgZEe7ttSCGsXIVFbraFkHtsyoTjBPDk4f2Wac&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQX-PShDZZbvAOb1zYIcFZ2TXUblIKI9NMN_Q8BXQfkhyw&oe=6B0F2391"}, {